摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH for Teams — Deploy DSH once on your LAN; memory, knowledge base & document search included. Team-ready, up to ~20 users. MIT-licensed.","id":"gh:1335456884","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"deepddw","slug":"ccch713/deepddw","topics":["ai-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","knowledge-base","llm","mcp","mcp-server","memory","self-hosted"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH for Teams — Deploy DSH once on your LAN; memory, knowledge base & document search included. Team"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"-ready, up to ~20 users. MIT-licensed."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"> 🚚 **Project update · 项目进展** — The standalone small-team product now lives at **Staffwright**: same"},{"id":"p2s2","text":" engine, complete product packaging, international-first. This repository continues as the deepDDW *"},{"id":"p2s3","text":"*DSH-plugin line** (memory & knowledge base for DeepSeek Harness).\n>\n> 独立的小团队产品线已迁移至 **Staffwright**"},{"id":"p2s4","text":"（同一引擎、完整产品化、面向国际市场）。本仓库继续作为 deepDDW 的 **DSH 插件线**（DeepSeek Harness 的记忆与知识库）维护。"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# deepDDW — Memory & Knowledge Base for DeepSeek Harness, Reachable from Any Device on Your LAN"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **English** · 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**deepDDW gives DeepSeek Harness (DSH) the three pieces it's missing — memory, a knowledge base, and"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" document search — and makes all of it reachable from *any* device on your LAN. No app install. No D"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"SH source changes.**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- 🧠 **Memory** — cross-session long-term memory, write/search via DSH's official MCP interface\n- 📚 *"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"*Knowledge base** — ingest & search your docs (industry docs, SOPs, research notes) anytime\n- 🎒 **Ta"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ke your AI assets with you** — one click packs memory + knowledge into a portable `ddw_assets_v1.zip"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"` (importable into DDW AI Hub or another deepDDW). Your data, your call — no lock-in\n- 🌐 **LAN-wide "},{"id":"p6s5","text":"multi-device** — deploy once; phones, laptops and tablets on the same network all use the same DSH w"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"vice** — deploy once; phones, laptops and tablets on the same network all use the same DSH workbench"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Try it in 60 seconds:**"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> 📸 *Screenshot: phone / tablet accessing the workbench (coming soon).*"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Status**: v0.8.1 · MIT · CI (pytest + ruff) ✅ · DSH for Teams — multi-user, LAN multi-device, memo"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ry & KB with team distillation · migration import/export, scope promote, incognito, retrieval health"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" · org binding server (bindcode-v1, optional) · **virtual office (view-only activity visualization)*"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"* · **AI assets export/import (`ddw_assets_v1`, anti-lock-in)** · Listed in awesome-deepseek-harness"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"export/import (`ddw_assets_v1`, anti-lock-in)** · Listed in awesome-deepseek-harness · Roadmap below"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> ## ⚠️ IMPORTANT — Read Before Installing\n>\n> deepDDW implements **its own memory and knowledge-bas"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"e isolation**. To avoid conflicts or memory confusion, **before installing**:\n>\n> 1. **Back up** you"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"r existing memory and knowledge-base contents (wherever they live in your DSH setup);\n> 2. **Uninsta"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ll/disable** any other memory or knowledge-base plugins you have installed;\n> 3. Only then install d"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"eepDDW and let it own the memory & knowledge-base stack.\n>\n> Running deepDDW alongside other memory/"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"KB plugins may cause **data conflicts or memory mixing** between namespaces. You have been warned. ⚠"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"B plugins may cause **data conflicts or memory mixing** between namespaces. You have been warned. ⚠️"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Why deepDDW?"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Most DSH extensions give you memory *alone*. deepDDW is a **complete workstation** — memory + knowle"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"dge base + document search + **LAN-wide multi-device access**:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Official DSH limitation | deepDDW solution |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| 🔒 **Local-only access** | ✅ **LAN-wide access**: deploy once on a server; desktops, laptops, phone"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"s and tablets on the same network all connect |\n| 🧠 **No memory** | ✅ Long-term memory write/search "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"— conversation experience is accumulated |\n| 📚 **No knowledge base** | ✅ Knowledge base search/inges"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"t — industry docs, SOPs, research notes, callable anytime |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**In one sentence**: turn a \"personal toy\" into a tool a small team can actually use — **fully packa"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ged, easy to deploy, low maintenance, ready for small businesses** (up to ~20 people) for their dail"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"eploy, low maintenance, ready for small businesses** (up to ~20 people) for their daily AI workflow."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"deepDDW distills lessons from real-world enterprise deployments into the DSH ecosystem as open sourc"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"distills lessons from real-world enterprise deployments into the DSH ecosystem as open source (MIT)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Which Scenario Fits You?"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"deepDDW is built for **individuals, families, departments and small businesses — roughly up to 20 pe"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ople and 20 devices on one LAN**. Find your scenario:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Scenario | Typical setup | What you get |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| 🧑‍💻 **Individual · multi-device** | One person; laptop + phone + tablet | Deploy once on any alway"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"s-on machine you own (NAS / mini host / old PC): every device of yours shares the same memory & know"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ledge base, and the data never leaves your hardware. Don't want to run anything? **Pro Cloud** hosts"},{"id":"p21s4","text":" it for you with managed multi-device sync and daily backups. |\n| 👨‍👩‍👧 **Family · multi-person, mul"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"ti-device** | A household; one server, several members | \"Deploy once, the whole family can use it.\""},{"id":"p21s6","text":" Each member gets an independent account with a private memory namespace; **family distillation** me"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"rges everyone's recent highlights into a shared family space (rule-based dedup — works even without "},{"id":"p21s8","text":"an LLM key). |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## How It Works (Technical Path)"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Integration = DSH standard MCP**: DSH natively supports MCP clients; deepDDW exposes a standard `s"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"treamable-http` endpoint — **zero intrusion, zero changes to DSH source**. The UI, settings and mode"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"l configuration all remain official."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Why Does It Work on Your LAN?"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The official DSH listens on `localhost` only (for security), so phones/tablets cannot connect. deepD"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"DW solves this with **gateway proxying**:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- **DSH stays bound to localhost** (official security design preserved)\n- **deepDDW gateway listens "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"on the LAN**, any device opens `http://<server-ip>:8600/` to reach the original DSH workbench\n- All "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"data stays on **your** server — never leaves the LAN"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Deploy once, the whole family/team can use it** — a capability the official DSH does not provide."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Security & Privacy"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Capability | Description |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| 🔐 Local-only data | Knowledge base & memory stay on your server, never leave the LAN |\n| 🏠 LAN pas"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"sword-free | Optional (opt-in): LAN requests skip the token — **OFF by default** (set `DDW_LAN_BYPAS"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"S=1` to enable; trusted LANs only) |\n| 🌐 External access | Optional Token gate (short-code supported"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"); unauthorized → 401 |\n| 🛡️ DSH secure binding | DSH stays on localhost; gateway exposes it — offic"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"ial security design preserved |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
